    {
      "id": "6d44a49b-b405-4f06-b6b2-0f4698844137",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        336,
        -112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Using the following research, create a 60-second YouTube Shorts script.\n\nResearch:\n{{ $json.answer }}\n\nRequirements:\n\n- Create an engaging title.\n- Write a narration suitable for approximately 60 seconds.\n- Split the video into exactly 6 scenes.\n\nFor every scene return:\n\n- scene\n- text\n- visual_query\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nThe visual_query is used directly to search Pexels Videos.\n\nWrite search queries that are extremely specific and describe exactly what should appear in the video.\n\nUse between 4 and 8 words.\n\nFocus on visible objects and actions.\n\nNever use abstract concepts.\n\nAvoid words like:\ncinematic\nepic\n4K\nHD\nbeautiful\nbest\nfuture\ntechnology\ninnovation\n\nInstead describe what can actually be filmed.\n\nGood examples:\n\nscientist using quantum computer\nrobot working in laboratory\ndoctor using AI medical system\nsolar panels aerial view\nelectric car charging\ndrone flying over smart city\nserver racks data center\nperson wearing VR headset\nsatellite orbiting Earth\nrobotic arm assembling car\n\nBad examples:\n\nfuture technology\nAI future\nmodern innovation\ndigital transformation\nadvanced technology\nscience concept\n If the topic has no real stock footage, replace it with the closest real-world footage that represents the idea.\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert at generating search queries for the Pexels Videos API.\n\nYour ONLY goal is to maximize the chance of finding real stock footage.\n\nRules:\n\n- Think like a stock footage creator.\n- Describe things that people can actually film.\n- Never invent futuristic objects.\n- Never describe imaginary technology.\n- Never describe concepts.\n\nAlways search for:\n\npeople\nscientists\nlaboratories\ncomputers\nrobots\nservers\ncities\nhospitals\ncars\nsatellites\nfactories\ndrones\nrenewable energy\nwind turbines\nsolar panels\n\nIf a technology doesn't exist visually, search for something related to it.\n\nExamples:\n\nInstead of:\nquantum computer\n\nUse:\nscientist working in laboratory\n\nInstead of:\nfusion reactor\n\nUse:\nscientists in research laboratory\n\nInstead of:\nAI intelligence\n\nUse:\nperson typing on computer\n\nInstead of:\nfuture technology\n\nUse:\nserver room data center\n\nEach query should contain 3-6 words.\n\nReturn JSON only."
        }
      }
    },
